From: openEuler RISC-V Maintainers <noreply@example.invalid>
Date: Mon, 31 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] cmake: support version 3.27

The project does not use CMake 4.2-specific commands or properties.  Accept
CMake 3.27, the version shipped by openEuler 24.03 LTS SP3, for both build
entry points while retaining the existing C++23 and dependency requirements.

---
 CMakeLists.txt       | 2 +-
 cpack/CMakeLists.txt | 2 +-
 2 files changed, 2 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/CMakeLists.txt b/CMakeLists.txt
index 9ae1a4f..81e2381 100644
--- a/CMakeLists.txt
+++ b/CMakeLists.txt
@@ -1,4 +1,4 @@
-cmake_minimum_required(VERSION 4.2)
+cmake_minimum_required(VERSION 3.27)
 project(sysinfoviewer VERSION 0.3.1 LANGUAGES CXX)
 
 set(CMAKE_INSTALL_PREFIX "/usr" CACHE PATH "Install path prefix")
diff --git a/cpack/CMakeLists.txt b/cpack/CMakeLists.txt
index 56d3a73..cdd637f 100644
--- a/cpack/CMakeLists.txt
+++ b/cpack/CMakeLists.txt
@@ -1,4 +1,4 @@
-cmake_minimum_required(VERSION 4.2.0)
+cmake_minimum_required(VERSION 3.27)
 project(sysinfoviewer VERSION 0.2.3 LANGUAGES CXX)
 
 set(CMAKE_CXX_STANDARD 23)
-- 
2.50.1
